Interop only: two extra test hooks, on only with POPPYSEED_TEST_HOOKS=1 and POPPYSEED_INTEROP_HOOKS=1.
interopEndAllSessions ends every Session the memory store has held (spec 5.3 end_sessions takes no id);
interopConversation reads a conversation, so the adapter can find the operation the Company Agent proposed.

